{"video_id":"c5-kx2bwoCk","title":"Running LLMs locally: Practical LLM Performance on DGX Spark — Mozhgan Kabiri chimeh, NVIDIA","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":1151,"segments":[{"start":1.52,"duration":6.48,"text":"Hello everyone. I'm Moska Gabricima,"},{"start":4.92,"duration":5.24,"text":"developer relations manager at Nvidia,"},{"start":8.0,"duration":5.12,"text":"where I work closely with developers"},{"start":10.16,"duration":6.2,"text":"building and deploying AI systems."},{"start":13.12,"duration":5.96,"text":"Today, we're looking at running LLMs"},{"start":16.36,"duration":4.4,"text":"locally, practical LLM performance on"},{"start":19.08,"duration":4.76,"text":"the Jetson Spark."},{"start":20.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"This isn't a theoretical talk. It's a"},{"start":23.84,"duration":5.44,"text":"data-backed journey through the"},{"start":25.52,"duration":5.56,"text":"trade-offs of modern AI infrastructure."},{"start":29.28,"duration":3.32,"text":"Findings are based on hands-on"},{"start":31.08,"duration":4.32,"text":"experiments with the goal of"},{"start":32.6,"duration":5.84,"text":"understanding what's actually practical"},{"start":35.4,"duration":6.64,"text":"on a single system."},{"start":38.44,"duration":6.56,"text":"The evolution in AI puts greater demand"},{"start":42.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"on developer systems, creating two main"},{"start":45.0,"duration":4.24,"text":"challenges."},{"start":46.4,"duration":5.08,"text":"You either run out of memory or you do"},{"start":49.24,"duration":4.92,"text":"not have access to the right software"},{"start":51.48,"duration":6.28,"text":"stack. Then you end up and pushing"},{"start":54.16,"duration":6.0,"text":"everything to the cloud or data center."},{"start":57.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"As models move from experiments to"},{"start":60.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"production, concerns like cost"},{"start":62.48,"duration":3.96,"text":"predictability,"},{"start":64.16,"duration":5.28,"text":"data residency, and deterministic"},{"start":66.44,"duration":5.72,"text":"latency take center stage."},{"start":69.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"And iteration speed often depends often"},{"start":72.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"depends on access to shared"},{"start":74.48,"duration":5.0,"text":"infrastructure. And since your work will"},{"start":77.12,"duration":4.96,"text":"be scheduled against other competing"},{"start":79.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"workloads, it causes delays in"},{"start":82.08,"duration":4.48,"text":"development work as well."},{"start":84.32,"duration":5.08,"text":"So, the question becomes, can we bring"},{"start":86.56,"duration":5.32,"text":"some of that workflow closer to where"},{"start":89.4,"duration":5.2,"text":"development actually happens?"},{"start":91.88,"duration":4.88,"text":"To maximize developer productivity,"},{"start":94.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"local solutions to these challenges are"},{"start":96.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"required."},{"start":99.12,"duration":5.72,"text":"The Jetson Spark is designed from the"},{"start":101.48,"duration":7.0,"text":"ground up to build and run AI and can be"},{"start":104.84,"duration":6.52,"text":"used as a standalone system."},{"start":108.48,"duration":6.48,"text":"It's powered by the GB10 Grace Blackwell"},{"start":111.36,"duration":8.2,"text":"superchip, combining CPU and GPU with a"},{"start":114.96,"duration":8.52,"text":"unified memory architecture. With 128 GB"},{"start":119.56,"duration":6.4,"text":"of unified memory and NV4 support, it"},{"start":123.48,"duration":5.96,"text":"enables developers to work with models"},{"start":125.96,"duration":6.32,"text":"of up to around 200 billion parameters"},{"start":129.44,"duration":6.76,"text":"locally on a system that fits under the"},{"start":132.28,"duration":6.88,"text":"under a desk or on top of your desk."},{"start":136.2,"duration":5.48,"text":"It runs the same Nvidia AI software"},{"start":139.16,"duration":5.4,"text":"stack used in production environments,"},{"start":141.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"meaning workflows can move from desktop"},{"start":144.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"to data center or cloud with minimal"},{"start":147.52,"duration":4.48,"text":"changes."},{"start":148.88,"duration":5.48,"text":"The key idea here is not replacing the"},{"start":152.0,"duration":5.28,"text":"cloud, but bringing"},{"start":154.36,"duration":5.72,"text":"powerful AI development closer to the"},{"start":157.28,"duration":2.8,"text":"developer."},{"start":160.52,"duration":4.08,"text":"This is my setup."},{"start":162.64,"duration":4.8,"text":"Everything runs locally and is"},{"start":164.6,"duration":5.12,"text":"reproducible. To serve the models, I"},{"start":167.44,"duration":4.2,"text":"used vLLM"},{"start":169.72,"duration":5.0,"text":"with a set of quant models across"},{"start":171.64,"duration":5.4,"text":"different sizes and precision formats."},{"start":174.72,"duration":4.96,"text":"I run this inside an Nvidia optimized"},{"start":177.04,"duration":4.84,"text":"container. This would ensure that our"},{"start":179.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"environment is identical to what you"},{"start":181.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"would deploy in a data center."},{"start":184.64,"duration":4.76,"text":"And [snorts] instead of just showing raw"},{"start":186.0,"duration":5.48,"text":"results, I want to show you the how."},{"start":189.4,"duration":5.6,"text":"I built an automated benchmarking"},{"start":191.48,"duration":6.6,"text":"harness. Every model run from 1.5"},{"start":195.0,"duration":6.0,"text":"billion to 14 billion follows the same"},{"start":198.08,"duration":5.44,"text":"strict protocol. Environment isolation"},{"start":201.0,"duration":5.16,"text":"via Docker, three mandatory warm-up"},{"start":203.52,"duration":5.16,"text":"runs, and background GPU metrics logging"},{"start":206.16,"duration":5.4,"text":"at 1-second intervals."},{"start":208.68,"duration":5.28,"text":"On the left, you're looking at the"},{"start":211.56,"duration":4.92,"text":"orchestrator script."},{"start":213.96,"duration":4.32,"text":"For every execution, the script"},{"start":216.48,"duration":5.52,"text":"automatically generates a unique"},{"start":218.28,"duration":6.8,"text":"directory using a precise timestamp and"},{"start":222.0,"duration":5.92,"text":"a sanitized model ID. For every model"},{"start":225.08,"duration":6.32,"text":"run, it captures the full model's"},{"start":227.92,"duration":6.2,"text":"endpoint response and necessary metrics."},{"start":231.4,"duration":6.36,"text":"On the right, you see the result, a"},{"start":234.12,"duration":6.12,"text":"clean, versioned artifact of the run."},{"start":237.76,"duration":5.52,"text":"It contains everything to verify the"},{"start":240.24,"duration":5.64,"text":"findings, the metadata, and the text"},{"start":243.28,"duration":4.92,"text":"results from the benchmarks."},{"start":245.88,"duration":4.48,"text":"On the lower right, you can see an"},{"start":248.2,"duration":5.0,"text":"example command for getting things"},{"start":250.36,"duration":2.84,"text":"started."},{"start":253.76,"duration":4.2,"text":"Now, let's look at the actual"},{"start":255.96,"duration":4.76,"text":"measurement logic."},{"start":257.96,"duration":4.28,"text":"In an AI application, end-to-end latency"},{"start":260.72,"duration":3.72,"text":"is important,"},{"start":262.24,"duration":4.96,"text":"but time to first"},{"start":264.44,"duration":5.52,"text":"token is the metric that defines the"},{"start":267.2,"duration":4.84,"text":"user's perceived performance. If the"},{"start":269.96,"duration":4.76,"text":"first token arrives instantly, the"},{"start":272.04,"duration":5.44,"text":"application feels responsive. And this"},{"start":274.72,"duration":5.04,"text":"script here shows how we timestamp the"},{"start":277.48,"duration":3.96,"text":"very first chunk of a streaming"},{"start":279.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"response."},{"start":281.44,"duration":5.88,"text":"In this script, we're not just calling"},{"start":284.48,"duration":6.44,"text":"an API and waiting for a result. We're"},{"start":287.32,"duration":7.36,"text":"explicitly handling the streaming"},{"start":290.92,"duration":6.16,"text":"response from the vLLM server."},{"start":294.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"If you look at the highlighted block in"},{"start":297.08,"duration":4.12,"text":"the stream_once"},{"start":298.84,"duration":4.92,"text":"function, you'll see the timestamping"},{"start":301.2,"duration":4.72,"text":"logic."},{"start":303.76,"duration":5.08,"text":"To explore this in practice, I ran a"},{"start":305.92,"duration":4.68,"text":"series of experiments using vLLM on the"},{"start":308.84,"duration":3.92,"text":"Jetson Spark."},{"start":310.6,"duration":4.84,"text":"I tested different models, from a"},{"start":312.76,"duration":5.4,"text":"smaller instruction model to larger"},{"start":315.44,"duration":4.04,"text":"optimized variants, all under the same"},{"start":318.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"setup."},{"start":319.48,"duration":4.88,"text":"Everything was served locally."},{"start":322.16,"duration":4.52,"text":"The goal here wasn't to push theoretical"},{"start":324.36,"duration":5.88,"text":"limits, but to understand realistic"},{"start":326.68,"duration":6.24,"text":"behavior in a developer workflow."},{"start":330.24,"duration":4.47,"text":"Let's dive into the raw performance data"},{"start":332.92,"duration":1.8,"text":"I captured."},{"start":334.71,"duration":2.73,"text":">> [snorts]"},{"start":334.72,"duration":7.56,"text":">> This bar chart represents the completion"},{"start":337.44,"duration":9.0,"text":"token per second across the test set."},{"start":342.28,"duration":6.64,"text":"At the far left, you see the 1.5"},{"start":346.44,"duration":6.52,"text":"billion instruct model"},{"start":348.92,"duration":5.92,"text":"delivering a massive 61.73"},{"start":352.96,"duration":5.76,"text":"tokens per second."},{"start":354.84,"duration":8.36,"text":"But the most interesting data point for"},{"start":358.72,"duration":7.52,"text":"us is the 14 billion NVFB4"},{"start":363.2,"duration":6.36,"text":"model. Despite being nearly 10 times"},{"start":366.24,"duration":6.68,"text":"larger than the 1.5 billion model, it"},{"start":369.56,"duration":6.92,"text":"still achieves 20.19"},{"start":372.92,"duration":3.56,"text":"tokens per second."},{"start":376.76,"duration":4.8,"text":"I would say this is a critical"},{"start":378.8,"duration":5.64,"text":"engineering sweet spot. By leveraging"},{"start":381.56,"duration":5.84,"text":"Nvidia's NVFB4"},{"start":384.44,"duration":5.12,"text":"4-bit floating-point quantization, we"},{"start":387.4,"duration":5.2,"text":"were we are able to maintain a"},{"start":389.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"sophisticated, high-intelligent model at"},{"start":392.6,"duration":6.24,"text":"a throughput that is still faster than"},{"start":394.84,"duration":4.0,"text":"the average human reading speed."},{"start":398.92,"duration":5.52,"text":"What becomes very clear here is how"},{"start":401.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"aggressively throughput drops as model"},{"start":404.44,"duration":3.32,"text":"is scaled"},{"start":405.72,"duration":5.28,"text":"as models scale."},{"start":407.76,"duration":6.56,"text":"And how much quantization helps."},{"start":411.0,"duration":5.36,"text":"Have a look at the 14 billion base"},{"start":414.32,"duration":7.44,"text":"model."},{"start":416.36,"duration":7.96,"text":"It drops to just 8.40 tokens per second."},{"start":421.76,"duration":4.52,"text":"This proves that on Blackwell archi- on"},{"start":424.32,"duration":5.24,"text":"Blackwell hardware, the choice of"},{"start":426.28,"duration":5.48,"text":"quantization format is just as important"},{"start":429.56,"duration":4.36,"text":"as the hardware itself."},{"start":431.76,"duration":5.16,"text":"It's what allows the Jetson Spark to"},{"start":433.92,"duration":6.68,"text":"bridge the gap between research work and"},{"start":436.92,"duration":6.36,"text":"production prototyping engine."},{"start":440.6,"duration":5.12,"text":"The Spark allowed me to experiment with"},{"start":443.28,"duration":4.48,"text":"different precision formats locally and"},{"start":445.72,"duration":5.08,"text":"understand the trade-offs"},{"start":447.76,"duration":3.04,"text":"in the real time."},{"start":451.64,"duration":5.6,"text":"While throughput is a measure of raw"},{"start":453.36,"duration":6.92,"text":"power, time to first token is the metric"},{"start":457.24,"duration":5.08,"text":"that defines user experience."},{"start":460.28,"duration":4.64,"text":"It determines whether an application"},{"start":462.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"feels instant or broken."},{"start":464.92,"duration":6.4,"text":"In other words, it reflects how quickly"},{"start":467.44,"duration":3.88,"text":"the model is starts responding."},{"start":471.36,"duration":4.16,"text":"As we see in the results, the Jetson"},{"start":473.8,"duration":4.08,"text":"Spark delivers exceptional"},{"start":475.52,"duration":4.48,"text":"responsiveness."},{"start":477.88,"duration":5.28,"text":"The increase for larger models is"},{"start":480.0,"duration":5.68,"text":"expected. More parameters mean more"},{"start":483.16,"duration":4.56,"text":"computation before the first token is"},{"start":485.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"generated."},{"start":487.72,"duration":5.44,"text":"Out of all from this chart, the"},{"start":490.64,"duration":6.84,"text":"interesting ones are the comparison"},{"start":493.16,"duration":8.16,"text":"between the 14 billion parameter models,"},{"start":497.48,"duration":4.96,"text":"the base model and the NVFB4"},{"start":501.32,"duration":2.92,"text":"model."},{"start":502.44,"duration":5.44,"text":"As we can see,"},{"start":504.24,"duration":8.84,"text":"as we can see, the 14 billion NVFB4"},{"start":507.88,"duration":9.52,"text":"is 3.4 times faster to first token than"},{"start":513.08,"duration":7.52,"text":"the unoptimized 14 base model."},{"start":517.4,"duration":6.28,"text":"A key takeaway here from this data is"},{"start":520.6,"duration":5.08,"text":"that memory capacity is not the same as"},{"start":523.68,"duration":5.56,"text":"the memory bandwidth."},{"start":525.68,"duration":6.32,"text":"While the Jetson Spark's 128 GB of"},{"start":529.24,"duration":6.12,"text":"unified memory allows us to fit massive"},{"start":532.0,"duration":5.16,"text":"models up to 200 billion"},{"start":535.36,"duration":4.24,"text":"parameters,"},{"start":537.16,"duration":4.04,"text":"our throughput is still governed by how"},{"start":539.6,"duration":4.48,"text":"efficiently"},{"start":541.2,"duration":5.8,"text":"we can move data."},{"start":544.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"This is why NVFB4"},{"start":547.0,"duration":5.64,"text":"is the hero here."},{"start":550.0,"duration":5.2,"text":"It effectively increases our"},{"start":552.64,"duration":5.84,"text":"intelligence per byte,"},{"start":555.2,"duration":8.16,"text":"allowing a 14 billion model to feel as"},{"start":558.48,"duration":4.88,"text":"responsive as much smaller one."},{"start":563.44,"duration":4.24,"text":"After running all of these, two things"},{"start":565.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"stood out to me."},{"start":567.68,"duration":5.4,"text":"On when to use the Jetson Spark. For"},{"start":571.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"steady-state workloads,"},{"start":573.08,"duration":5.28,"text":"privacy-sensitive data,"},{"start":576.12,"duration":4.64,"text":"and rapid prototyping."},{"start":578.36,"duration":5.04,"text":"It allows you to build and fine-tune"},{"start":580.76,"duration":6.4,"text":"locally with the exact same software"},{"start":583.4,"duration":7.04,"text":"stack used in Jetson cloud."},{"start":587.16,"duration":5.64,"text":"Visit build.nvidia.com/spark"},{"start":590.44,"duration":5.44,"text":"to access the playbooks and software"},{"start":592.8,"duration":5.32,"text":"stack I used for these benchmarks."},{"start":595.88,"duration":5.32,"text":"And in one"},{"start":598.12,"duration":6.68,"text":"run locally, iterate quickly, and when"},{"start":601.2,"duration":5.92,"text":"ready, scale to data center or cloud."},{"start":604.8,"duration":5.08,"text":"That's the workflow that J uses Spark"},{"start":607.12,"duration":2.76,"text":"enables."}]}